# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Downloaded DATA — never commit.  Survey 2026-09-28:
#   67 FITS = 31 GiB on disk (Planck PR3 HFI/LFI SkyMap + SMICA/NILC/COMMANDER
#   IQU + masks, eBOSS LRG randoms, CEERS DR1, SPT-3G).  Everything here is
#   re-fetchable from its public archive (Planck PLA / IRSA / DESI / MAST),
#   so the repo should hold the download script, never the bytes.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.fits
*.fits.gz
*.fits.fz
*.fit
*.fz

# Downloaded binary installers (polymake .deb etc.) — re-fetchable via apt.
*.deb

# Derived FITS caches (regenerated by the analysis scripts; safe to delete).
*_cache/

# Downloaded polytope catalogue (CY3 O53) — 15 parquet files = 14.6 GiB.
# Path-anchored on purpose: a *.parquet rule would also swallow small,
# deliberately-tracked tables elsewhere.
open_problems_fresh/o53_cy3_reality/data/polytopes-4d/

